WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.599 --> 00:00:04.230 align:start position:0%
 
president putin  recently  you ordered your troops into ukraine  which is a sovereign nation  and this was a mistake  you underestimated the capability  and the fighting spirit of the brave  ukrainian people  and that's understandable  my country  made that same mistake  in vietnam  in iraq  and in afghanistan  these mistakes  led to drawn out conflicts  that depleted our finances  our materials  and cost us much of our most precious  resource of all  american blood  your country  has made that same mistake in the past  as well  in afghanistan  and more recently  in chechnya  now you have made that same mistake  again but you have also made another  mistake  you misjudged  the international community  who  has universally condemned your actions  you have been  cut off financially  your supply chain has been severed  you are standing alone from a military  perspective you will receive no support  yet on the contrary  your enemy  the free people of ukraine  are going to receive an unlimited supply  of weapons  ammunition fuel food  and troops  from nations around the world  this will be a war of attrition  against the most well-supported freedom  fighters the world has ever seen  and you will lose  that is the reality  but i don't want that  i do not want war i do not want  suffering  and i don't want to see  our once great ally the russian people  consumed  by the devastation of war  so  i am solemnly requesting  that you immediately correct this  mistake by withdrawing all your troops  from ukraine starting within the next 48  hours  if you do so  i will personally see to it  that there are no further ramifications  against your country  i will find a way to negotiate a  peaceful agreement with ukraine that  addresses your concerns and finally  i will help  rebuild your infrastructure  and i will support actions that will  help to rebuild your economy  this is a generous offer to your nation  a nation  with a history of great strength  a nation who we once  stood side by side with  to defeat the evil third reich  i hope  you accept  this request for peace  but  if you do not comply  there will be consequences  i have been to war  and i do not like it  but i know how to wage it  12 hours ago i gave an order sending  three aircraft carrier battle groups to  the vicinity  i also gave the order for the deployment  of 50 000 combat ready soldiers sailors  airmen and marines to our nato allies  bordering ukraine  these include  surface-to-air and surface-to-surface  missile systems  it includes combat aviation and aviation  support teams  and it also includes medical  logistics infantry and special  operations units  the united states of america will bring  the full spectrum of lethal warfare to  the battlefield  that being said we will not get into a  ground war with you  america does not need to  the brave ukrainian men and women will  fight for their own  country  history tells us of their courage  and they are already proving their medal  in battle once again  but with our technological capabilities  and assets are eminently prepared troops  and our partnerships with allies and the  undaunted ukrainian people on the ground  i promise you  your aircraft will be  destroyed your missile systems will be  destroyed  all of your tanks and armored fighting  vehicles will be destroyed  your naval vessels in proximity of the  conflict will be destroyed  and many of your fine soldiers and  sailors will be killed  it will be a devastating loss  and your country's military  and economy  will take years to rebuild  but i don't want that  my generation of americans have been at  war for two decades we don't want war  we want peace  for russia  for ukraine for europe and for the world  so please carefully consider my offer  withdraw your troops  and let's move forward together  in a positive way  that avoids further war and bloodshed  and brings peace and prosperity to the  world  the choice is yours  i am standing by for your reply

